================================================================================

        U L T I M A T E   M O R P H   C R E A T O R
        (Toilet World Roleplay 2)

        A helper for making custom morphs the way the game makes them, in
        your private server: with the game's own building tools (Fork3x or
        BTools) and its Save Morph Tool. It builds nothing itself: every
        change the others see is yours, made with the game's tools. It
        shows you the way and does the rest, only for you:

          * the guide, step by step, each step checked: the morph you work
            on, the piece you take from another, in place, inside it,
            welded, tried, saved
          * on-screen keys for the tools' shortcuts (Shift+J, Shift+U,
            Shift+T, Ctrl to pick more parts...), for phones
          * what would fall: every part of a morph not welded to its body,
            and the body part to weld it to
          * its colours: its palette, recoloured first for you only, the
            codes to paint it with; its particles' and effects' colours
          * the catalog and the toolbox searched (Skibidi Toilet...), a
            preview, the mesh and texture ids for the Mesh tool
          * the morph seen from outside: a copy of it before you, the
            camera round it, the map faded round it, a ruler

            loadstring(game:HttpGet("https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bonellocristian78-lab/Gradish-Mode/claude/sei-qui-con-noi-ye4k62/UltimateMorphCreator"))()

        Its window is Obsidian's (deividcomsono/Obsidian), on a phone and on
